From f3c0db258b8447d7a175053a8fd397be9cff40c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <87899750+Riteshp2001@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 00:22:49 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 008/140] fix(player): sync ambient crop, lyrics, and audio
 ribbons

- size YouTube Ambient from post-crop video geometry and refresh on crop changes
- parse whole-second embedded LRC timestamps into the animated synced-lyrics path
- drive the three sine ribbons from live low, mid, and high audio bands plus continuously refreshed system output volume
- preserve ordered proportional lift and a 30 percent speed ceiling while joining ribbons beneath rounded track edges
